[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7985.39, "timestamp": "02:13:05", "text": "他们。我做了很多事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7988.709, "timestamp": "02:13:08", "text": "错误。听起来确实如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7994.99, "timestamp": "02:13:14", "text": "是的，我私下做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8002.91, "timestamp": "02:13:22", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8005.43, "timestamp": "02:13:25", "text": "等等，你知道，就像一句美好的早晨"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8008.629, "timestamp": "02:13:28", "text": "报警装置。那些人就在那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8012.87, "timestamp": "02:13:32", "text": "就像我的测试对象一样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8016.589, "timestamp": "02:13:36", "text": "呃，因为我想做一件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8018.51, "timestamp": "02:13:38", "text": "嗯声音"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8021.589, "timestamp": "02:13:41", "text": "语音包。所以我就想"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8024.83, "timestamp": "02:13:44", "text": "通过以下方式进行测试："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8032.109, "timestamp": "02:13:52", "text": "东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8036.2, "timestamp": "02:13:56", "text": "是的，那些还不够完美。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 8039.109, "timestamp": "02:13:59", "text": "[音乐]"}]